  "cmd_full_name": "aidge video-generation",
  "cmd_name": "video-generation",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Invokes the e-commerce AI video generation agent for e-commerce merchants and platforms. Based on product main images, titles, selling points, and other information, it automatically generates 5–30 second product showcase short videos, helping customers efficiently produce and distribute e-commerce content. The service supports multiple resolution outputs such as 720P and 1080P, single-product quick invocation and multi-product batch generation, catering to both daily operations and large-scale product content production needs. Currently overwrites all apparel categories (tops, pants, skirts, suits, underwear, swimwear, etc.), and is gradually expanding to skincare, cosmetics, food and beverages, home appliances, and other core e-commerce categories",
  "description_zh": "电商AI视频生成Agent面向电商商家与平台，基于商品主图、标题、卖点等信息，自动生成 5–30 秒商品展示短视频，帮助客户高效完成电商内容生产与分发。产品支持 720P、1080P 等多种清晰度输出，支持单商品快速调用与多商品批量生成，兼顾日常运营和大规模商品内容生产需求。当前已覆盖服饰全品类（上衣、裤装、裙装、套装、内衣、泳装等），逐步拓展至护肤品、化妆品、食品饮料、家用电器等电商核心类目",
  "kebab_example": "",
